  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The HTTP API layer should call a service ( passing http request) whose sole purpose is to  populates the FedoraResource from an http request.  The http api will then coordinate resource creation by making a call to the resource service to get a FedoraResource followed by a call to the PersistentStorageSession.create() The task here is to create interface and stub out new implementation  and test class.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
